# An action rather than `kind: packages`, because pnpm derives the shims it
# writes from each package's own metadata: there is no mapping from
# `@openai/codex` back to the command it produced, so the engine has nothing
# to diff against. The script installs unconditionally, which pnpm treats as
# an upgrade in place.
#
# Requires `dotfiles` — a working global install reads the pnpm configuration
# that unit deploys: without it the shims land outside PATH. The script
# checks for the config rather than trusting the ordering.
kind: action
capabilities: develop
requires: develop-packages, dotfiles
optional: pnpm
